# environment variables — NEVER commit real secrets (Mongo URI, NextAuth
# secret, Cloudinary/Resend/Zoom keys, seed admin password, etc).
# Every .env* variant is ignored by default; only the checked-in example
# template (placeholder values only, no real credentials) stays tracked.
.env*
!.env.example

